  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating a Conducive Eco/community-based tourism Landscape in Northern Botswana Through Strengthening CSOs.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Grant awarded in response to 2 specific objectives being:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific Objective 1&lt;/strong&gt;: To encourage alliances between CSOs (including grassroots women and youths organizations) to develop a more inclusive, participatory, empowered and independent Civil Society in favour of Good Governance, Climate action, and Women, Girls&#xbf; and Youth Empowerment , child protection and Gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective 2:&lt;/strong&gt; To develop the capacity of CSOs so that they can better lobby and advocate in favour of good governance and gender equality and Women, Girls&#xbf; and Youth Empowerment as well as the rights of indigenous people.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The priority of this call for proposals is the promotion of broad and inclusive political and social dialogue in the Social Sector.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
